@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-22 - Track Return Status

actor "User" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Product Review UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-22
FE -> API: GET /returns/user/:userId
API -> Service: Execute Track Return Status
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Hiển thị trạng thái yêu cầu đổi trả

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Chưa có return request -> empty state
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã tạo return request
Post: Hiển thị trạng thái yêu cầu đổi trả
Main flow:
1. User vào trang /my-returns
2. System gọi API GET /returns/user/:userId
3. System trả về danh sách return requests (type, reason, status,\nadminNote, createdAt)
4. User click vào để xem chi tiết
end note
@enduml
